    {
      "id": "cpp.book.5-1",
      "title": "while循环",
      "number": "5.1",
      "parent": "cpp.book.chapter-5",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 82,
      "printedPage": 70,
      "leaf": true,
      "group": 5,
      "body": [
        "`while` 在每次循环前检查条件。要写出向终止条件推进的量，并考虑初值已经不满足条件。"
      ],
      "example": {
        "mode": "reading",
        "reason": "阅读示例。按下列输入、状态或输出手工核对本节概念。",
        "description": "用 `while(i<3)` 输出 0、1、2，每次循环后将 i 加一。",
        "source": null,
        "result": null
      },
      "activity": {
        "mode": "self-check",
        "prompt": "i 一开始是 3 会输出什么？",
        "answer": "循环体一次也不执行。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp.book.5-2",
      "title": "do...while循环",
      "number": "5.2",
      "parent": "cpp.book.chapter-5",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 83,
      "printedPage": 71,
      "leaf": true,
      "group": 5,
      "body": [
        "后测循环先执行大括号内的更新，再求条件。即使初始状态已满足退出条件，首次更新仍会发生。",
        "循环尾部的分号属于语法。`continue` 会前往尾部条件。"
      ],
      "example": {
        "mode": "wasm",
        "description": "输入 0，k 从 0 写到 1，再检查 `1<0`。条件为假，输出 1。",
        "source": "#include <iostream>\nint main() { int n=0; int k=0; std::cin >> n; do { k=k+1; } while(k<n); std::cout << k << std::endl; }\n",
        "cases": [
          {
            "id": "case-1",
            "expected": "5\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                5
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "case-2",
            "expected": "1\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                0
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "case-3",
            "expected": "1\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                1
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "case-4",
            "expected": "1\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                -7
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "activity": {
        "mode": "judge",
        "profile": "cpp.book.5-2.exercise",
        "prompt": "输入 n。令 k 从零开始，在每次循环中将 k 加一，直到 k 大于等于 n，输出 k。即使 n 非正也至少执行一次。",
        "starter": "#include <iostream>\nint main() {\n  // 在这里编写你的解法\n  return 0;\n}\n",
        "hint": "循环尾部的分号属于语法。`continue` 会前往尾部条件。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp.book.5-3",
      "title": "while与do...while比较",
      "number": "5.3",
      "parent": "cpp.book.chapter-5",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 84,
      "printedPage": 73,
      "leaf": true,
      "group": 5,
      "body": [
        "`while` 可以零次执行。`do/while` 总会先完成一轮动作，再评估是否继续。"
      ],
      "example": {
        "mode": "reading",
        "reason": "阅读示例。按下列输入、状态或输出手工核对本节概念。",
        "description": "模拟读取后才判定是否结束的交互适合先执行体。计数初值已经越界时可用前测循环。",
        "source": null,
        "result": null
      },
      "activity": {
        "mode": "self-check",
        "prompt": "同一个假条件让两种循环各执行几次？",
        "answer": "while 零次，do/while 一次。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp.book.5-4",
      "title": "for循环语句",
      "number": "5.4",
      "parent": "cpp.book.chapter-5",
      "depth": 3,
      "order": 85,
      "printedPage": 74,
      "leaf": true,
      "group": 5,
      "body": [
        "`for` 先初始化 i，每轮开始时判断边界，执行循环体后做更新。总和在第 i 轮前保存前 i-1 项。",
        "写成 `i<n` 会漏掉最后一项。n 为零时循环体不进入。"
      ],
      "example": {
        "mode": "wasm",
        "description": "输入 3，sum 依次为 1、3、6。i 变为 4 后退出。",
        "source": "#include <iostream>\nint main() { int n=0; int sum=0; std::cin >> n; for(int i=1; i<=n; i=i+1){ sum=sum+i; } std::cout << sum << std::endl; }\n",
        "cases": [
          {
            "id": "case-1",
            "expected": "21\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                6
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "case-2",
            "expected": "0\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                0
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "case-3",
            "expected": "1\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                1
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "case-4",
            "expected": "210\n",
            "input": {
              "kind": "integers",
              "values": [
                20
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "activity": {
        "mode": "judge",
        "profile": "cpp.book.5-4.exercise",
        "prompt": "输入 n，输出从 1 到 n 的整数和，n 小于 1 时输出零。",
        "starter": "#include <iostream>\nint main() {\n  // 在这里编写你的解法\n  return 0;\n}\n",
        "hint": "写成 `i<n` 会漏掉最后一项。n 为零时循环体不进入。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cpp.book.5-5",
      "title": "循环控制",
      "number": "5.5",
